WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:07.460
Matthew 10. And he called to him his twelve disciples and gave them authority over unclean

00:07.460 --> 00:13.840
spirits to cast them out, and to heal every disease and every affliction. The names of

00:13.840 --> 00:19.460
the twelve apostles are these. First, Simon, who is called Peter, and Andrew his brother,

00:20.020 --> 00:26.460
James the son of Zebedee, and John his brother, Philip and Bartholomew, Thomas and Matthew

00:26.460 --> 00:32.860
the tax collector, James the son of Alphaeus and Thaddaeus, Simon the Canaanite, and Judas

00:32.860 --> 00:40.380
Iscariot, who betrayed him. These twelve Jesus sent out, instructing them, Go nowhere among

00:40.380 --> 00:46.580
the Gentiles, and enter no town of the Samaritans, but go rather to the lost sheep of the house

00:46.580 --> 00:53.500
of Israel, and proclaim as you go, saying, The kingdom of heaven is at hand. Heal the

00:53.500 --> 00:56.360
sick, raise the dead, cleanse lepers.

00:56.460 --> 01:04.060
Cast out demons. You received without pain. Give without pay. Acquire no gold, nor silver,

01:04.160 --> 01:10.000
nor copper for your belts, no bag for your journey, nor two tunics, nor sandals, nor

01:10.000 --> 01:16.840
a staff, for the laborer deserves his food. And whatever town or village you enter, find

01:16.840 --> 01:22.420
out who is worthy in it, and stay there until you depart. As you enter the house, greet

01:22.420 --> 01:25.780
it, and if the house is worthy, let your peace come upon it.

01:26.220 --> 01:26.440
But if the house is worthy, let your peace come upon it.

01:26.440 --> 01:32.300
But if it is not worthy, let your peace return to you. And if anyone will not receive you

01:32.300 --> 01:37.620
or listen to your words, shake off the dust from your feet when you leave that house or

01:37.620 --> 01:43.200
town. Truly I say to you, it will be more bearable on the day of judgment for the land

01:43.200 --> 01:50.560
of Sodom and Gomorrah than for that town. Behold, I am sending you out as sheep in the

01:50.560 --> 01:55.020
midst of wolves, so be wise as serpents and innocent as doves.

01:55.020 --> 02:01.180
Beware of men, for they will deliver you over to courts and flog you in their synagogues,

02:01.280 --> 02:06.680
and you will be dragged before governors and kings for my sake to bear witness before them

02:06.680 --> 02:13.180
and the Gentiles. When they deliver you over, do not be anxious how you are to speak or

02:13.180 --> 02:18.400
what you are to say, for what you are to say will be given to you in that hour. For it

02:18.400 --> 02:24.640
is not you who speak, but the Spirit of your Father speaking through you. Brother will

02:24.640 --> 02:25.000
deliver you over to courts and flog you in their synagogues, and you will be dragged

02:25.000 --> 02:31.240
over to death. And the father his child, and children will rise against parents and have

02:31.240 --> 02:38.000
them put to death. And you will be hated by all for my name's sake. But the one who endures

02:38.000 --> 02:44.380
to the end will be saved. When they persecute you in one town, flee to the next. For truly

02:44.380 --> 02:49.220
I say to you, you will not have gone through all the towns of Israel before the Son of

02:49.220 --> 02:54.680
Man comes. A disciple is not above his teacher, nor a

02:54.680 --> 02:54.980
servant above his teacher. He is not above his teacher, nor a servant above his teacher.

02:55.000 --> 03:00.020
He is not above his master. It is enough for the disciple to be like his teacher, and

03:00.020 --> 03:04.900
the servant like his master. If they have called the master of the house Beelzebul,

03:05.380 --> 03:12.280
how much more will they malign those of his household? So have no fear of them, for nothing

03:12.280 --> 03:17.920
is covered that will not be revealed, or hidden that will not be known. What I tell you in

03:17.920 --> 03:24.080
the dark, say in the light, and what you hear whispered, proclaim on the housetops. And

03:24.080 --> 03:24.980
do not fear those who are not in the house. And do not fear those who are not in the house.

03:25.000 --> 03:30.080
Do not fear those who kill the body, but cannot kill the soul. Rather, fear him who

03:30.080 --> 03:37.040
can destroy both soul and body in hell. Are not two sparrows sold for a penny? And

03:37.040 --> 03:42.740
not one of them will fall to the ground apart from your father. But even the hairs of your

03:42.740 --> 03:49.020
head are all numbered. Fear not, therefore. You are of more value than many sparrows.

03:49.280 --> 03:54.980
So everyone who acknowledges me before men, I also will acknowledge before my own people.

03:54.980 --> 04:02.740
My father who is in heaven. But whoever denies me before men, I also will deny before my father

04:02.740 --> 04:08.840
who is in heaven. Do not think that I have come to bring peace to the earth. I have not come to

04:08.840 --> 04:15.540
bring peace, but a sword. For I have come to set a man against his father, and a daughter against

04:15.540 --> 04:21.100
her mother, and a daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law, and a person's enemies will be

04:21.100 --> 04:22.980
those of his own household.

04:24.980 --> 04:30.420
Whoever loves father or mother more than me is not worthy of me. And whoever loves son

04:30.420 --> 04:36.080
or daughter more than me is not worthy of me. And whoever does not take his cross and

04:36.080 --> 04:43.360
follow me is not worthy of me. Whoever finds his life will lose it. And whoever loses his

04:43.360 --> 04:51.480
life for my sake will find it. Whoever receives you receives me. And whoever receives me receives

04:51.480 --> 04:52.400
him who sent me.

04:52.840 --> 04:54.960
The one who receives a prophet because he is a prophet is a prophet.

04:54.960 --> 05:03.580
The one who receives a righteous person because he is a righteous person will receive a righteous

05:03.580 --> 05:10.960
person's reward. And whoever gives one of these little ones even a cup of cold water because he

05:10.960 --> 05:16.580
is a disciple, truly I say to you, he will by no means lose his reward.

